      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This keeps coming up around groups of friends of mine. I think it'd be a pretty good idea. There's a number of people who have suggested this in the canny, but this is the one I've seen with the most votes. \n\nI'll try to bump the idea where I can.",
